    "about_text_1": {
      "type": "html",
      "label": "About Paragraph 1",
      "default": "There's a certain kind of chef you come across once in a while—the kind who doesn't just cook, but <strong>understands people, performance, and precision</strong> at a level that goes far beyond the kitchen. That's exactly what you get with Chef Red."
    },
    "about_text_2": {
      "type": "html",
      "label": "About Paragraph 2",
      "default": "With over 20 years in the culinary industry, Chef Red's journey began through the intensity and discipline of professional kitchens, training under highly skilled and respected chefs. Today, he operates at the <strong>intersection of culinary excellence and performance nutrition</strong> as a Personal Chef and Certified Nutrition Coach."
    },
    "about_text_3": {
      "type": "html",
      "label": "About Paragraph 3",
      "default": "He brings a calm, professional presence into every home, operating with <strong>discretion, consistency, and an intuitive understanding of high-level expectations</strong>. He adapts seamlessly to each client's lifestyle, preferences, and nutritional needs."
